                "img": "https://arxiv.org/html/2609.15659/2609.15659v1/figures/teaser.png",
                "caption": "Figure 1:Part-aware image-to-3D generation with KaiNinja.Each mesh is generated by our model from a single RGB image, with no 2D mask,\nno part segmenter, and no per-object optimization in the geometry pipeline.\nMaterials are added with TRELLIS.2 for visualization; mirror reflections use\ndistinct colors to show individual parts. Each part is a separate,\nself-contained sub-mesh that can be moved, retextured, or rigged on its own.",
                "position": 354
            }
        ]
